    "posts": [
      {
        "id": 20192,
        "name": "Harknail",
        "username": "Harknail",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/harknail/{size}/1972_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-08-23T04:56:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In a recent game I was playing, the players finally got a change to use their Misdirection abilities. And realized that unlike any other ability, Misdirection punishes the characters for rolling high. This is the only power we've found where you get a better result (more damage passed on to a minion) if you roll low.</p>\n<p>The description of the ability is:&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>When a nearby hero in the Yellow or Red zone would take damage, Defend against that damage by rolling your single [power] die, then redirect any remaining damage to a nearby minion of your choice.</strong></p>\n<p>So the better you roll on the defense, the less remaining damage there is to redirect to a minion. While it's still a useful power (it saved a lot of damage being done to a key character), they players felt that they were missing something since their good defend rolls resulted in no damage to redirect.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Any comments? Are we missing something? Anyone have a sugested house rule to emphasies the damage redirection?</p>\n<p>One thought I had is to allow them to change the power description to this:</p>\n<p><strong>When a nearby hero in the Yellow or Red zone would take damage, roll&nbsp;your single [power] die to either boost or hinder the damage, then redirect any remaining damage to a nearby minion of your choice if any are available.</strong></p>\n<p>This allows all the damage to be redirected + more for a good roll. Downside is that it's much less effective if there are no minions around or if the minions are freindly. Comments?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:11.664Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 9,
        "readers_count": 8,
        "score": 1.8,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 20191,
        "topic_slug": "misdirection-strangness",
        "display_username": "Harknail",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
