        "raw": "<p>I'd say it makes sense for balancing reasons, the way it is.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It gives some advantage to characters with less-than-maxed dice, as they are slightly better at passively taking out opponents (think \"jackie chan dodges his way through a group&nbsp;fight\")</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Having crazily high defense (i.e. strong&nbsp;dice)&nbsp;AND passively dishing&nbsp;out&nbsp;is a bit overpowered imho.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We have to keep in mind that this is a game where&nbsp;not every player creates their character for max efficiency, but for a narrative persona they enjoy. The battle scenes still have to work for these.</p>",
